WEBVTT

00:02.760 --> 00:04.780
<i>My name is Ikusaba Asahi.</i>

00:04.780 --> 00:07.010
<i>I'm a completely average high school student.</i>

00:07.400 --> 00:09.310
<i>After a traffic accident,</i>

00:09.310 --> 00:11.740
<i>my dream of going to 
another world came true,</i>

00:11.740 --> 00:14.330
<i>and I'm living my best life
 as an adventurer.</i>

00:15.870 --> 00:16.750
<i>Except...</i>

00:22.810 --> 00:23.730
I did it!

00:27.480 --> 00:32.090
<i>Unfortunately, my skills and abilities
 are also completely average.</i>

00:32.360 --> 00:36.230
<i>So I'm as far from being one of those 
"I'm so OP!" adventurers as can be.</i>

00:36.760 --> 00:38.760
Everyone! Get him!

00:41.140 --> 00:44.810
<i>But I do have one special 
trait that isn't normal.</i>

00:44.810 --> 00:46.040
<i>And that is...</i>

00:49.140 --> 00:51.780
Bis Sis Fire!

00:57.950 --> 00:59.120
<i>That is...</i>

01:00.260 --> 01:03.170
<i>I have the strongest big sister
 in this other world.</i>

01:04.080 --> 01:05.590
Are you all right, Asahi?

01:05.590 --> 01:07.080
Maya-nee.

01:07.420 --> 01:09.610
You said I wouldn't need help.

01:09.960 --> 01:11.590
Not in a one-on-one.

01:11.870 --> 01:15.420
But when you're outnumbered, 
it's a different story.

01:15.420 --> 01:17.840
Well, you really did save me.

01:17.840 --> 01:20.510
You've got dirt all over you.

01:20.750 --> 01:25.960
Brush! Brush! Pat! Pat! Brush! Pat!

01:21.150 --> 01:22.890
Thanks, Maya-nee.

01:22.890 --> 01:27.180
<i>But this dependable sister of mine also
has a special trait that isn't normal.</i>

01:27.180 --> 01:28.100
<i>And that is...</i>

01:28.440 --> 01:30.060
<b>Grab</b>

01:28.440 --> 01:30.060
<b>Grab</b>

01:28.830 --> 01:30.060
"Grab"?

01:30.060 --> 01:31.130
Asahi.

01:31.880 --> 01:34.280
You really do have a nice butt, don't you?

01:34.280 --> 01:35.990
It gets me all aflutter.

01:37.790 --> 01:38.950
<i>This sister of mine...</i>

01:38.950 --> 01:41.650
<i>is majorly brother-obsessed.</i>

01:38.950 --> 01:42.330
<b>Brother-Obsessed</b>

01:42.330 --> 01:44.330
But your butt's not enough to satisfy me!

01:42.450 --> 01:49.210
<b>Glomp</b>

01:44.330 --> 01:47.250
Let me inspect every inch of your 
body to see how you've grown!

01:47.250 --> 01:49.710
S-Stop that, you pervy big sister!

01:49.710 --> 01:53.810
<i>I have to hurry up and get to the point 
where I can handle stuff on my own.</i>

01:54.280 --> 01:57.460
What are you planning to do on your own?
 Let your big sister do it, too!

01:58.070 --> 01:59.140
I told you before...

01:59.140 --> 02:02.360
Don't read people's thoughts!

