03:32.980 --> 03:35.900
<b>Episode 3</b>

03:32.980 --> 03:35.900
<b>My Sister,
\hMaya-nee, Is All I\h\h\h\h\h Need</b>

03:36.360 --> 03:39.740
<b>Kingdom of Ceasarion</b>

03:39.740 --> 03:41.730
Aw, sweet!

03:39.740 --> 03:43.320
<b>Capital City: Epiphoneia</b>

03:41.730 --> 03:43.320
What is it, Asahi?

03:43.630 --> 03:45.780
I finally reached Level 10!

03:45.780 --> 03:47.110
Double digits!

03:47.110 --> 03:49.080
That's wonderful! Congrats!

03:49.080 --> 03:53.250
It's the kind of level you reach by finishing
 the tutorial, but I'm still really happy.

03:53.700 --> 03:54.920
But...

03:55.560 --> 03:59.360
That means hardly any EXP from the 
dozens if not hundreds of monsters I beat

03:59.360 --> 04:02.020
actually went to you, Asahi.

04:02.020 --> 04:05.840
It looks like what I get is based 
on how much damage I inflict.

04:05.840 --> 04:08.650
Or it could be to do with how 
much I contribute to a battle?

04:05.840 --> 04:13.690
mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter mutter

