11:12.940 --> 11:15.940
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

11:19.710 --> 11:22.170
Now that I've had some water, I feel better.

11:22.170 --> 11:23.730
Thanks, Asahi-kun.

11:23.730 --> 11:27.510
I'm glad to hear it, but, well, uh...

11:27.920 --> 11:32.920
You <i>are</i> Siegfried-san, aren't you? 
The Dragon Class adventurer?

11:32.920 --> 11:35.240
The one they call the "Dragon Hunter"?

11:37.130 --> 11:42.930
Right now, I'm... I mean, as I am right now,
 I am undeserving of such an impressive title.

11:42.930 --> 11:44.930
I know. "Loyal Dog Pochi."

11:45.390 --> 11:47.810
Loyal Dog Pochi is the right title for me.

11:47.810 --> 11:50.930
"Pochi"? Huh? What happened to him?

11:51.190 --> 11:56.380
We set out to defeat the Demon King, 
but we failed spectacularly.

11:56.380 --> 12:00.730
Feel free to laugh. 
We were beaten by a single demon.

12:00.730 --> 12:01.610
What?

12:03.200 --> 12:05.700
The demon's power was overwhelming.

12:06.160 --> 12:09.910
No matter what attacks we used, 
they got batted away like a baby's fist.

12:10.670 --> 12:14.020
What's more, the demon hadn't 
even begun to fight seriously.

12:15.150 --> 12:18.160
I-I never imagined anyone 
so fearsome could exist.

12:19.260 --> 12:23.620
Because of that, I lost all confidence 
in myself, and now all I do is drink.

12:23.620 --> 12:25.310
I am as you see me.

12:25.310 --> 12:26.890
Siegfried-san.

12:28.310 --> 12:29.450
That's the problem!

12:29.450 --> 12:32.900
Why'd my parents give me a 
pretentious name like "Siegfried"?!

12:32.900 --> 12:35.410
I worked hard to ensure 
I didn't bring shame to that name!

12:35.410 --> 12:38.630
I even tried to be cool by 
trying to sound devil-may-care!

12:38.630 --> 12:41.860
Before I knew it, I got roped into
 going off to defeat the Demon King!

12:41.860 --> 12:43.700
And then, we were wiped out!

12:43.700 --> 12:46.630
The townsfolk feel let down 
and point fingers behind my back!

12:46.630 --> 12:49.440
Isn't that just too wretched?! I'm only 28!

12:49.440 --> 12:52.880
B-But y'know, you have gained 
some irreplaceable things, right?

12:52.880 --> 12:56.160
Allies, friends, all kinds of memories...

12:56.160 --> 12:59.090
Tanya was just telling me how
Balmung is the ideal party.

12:59.650 --> 13:01.090
Listen up, Asahi-kun.

13:01.090 --> 13:01.850
Huh?

13:02.560 --> 13:04.720
Real life doesn't work that way.

13:04.720 --> 13:05.770
I'm sorry?

13:05.770 --> 13:09.950
I will tell you about the 
natural order of things in this world.

13:09.950 --> 13:10.850
I'm sorry?

13:11.330 --> 13:15.600
Mimosa loves to have a good time. 
She spends all the clan's money in host clubs.

13:16.230 --> 13:17.650
And the elf, Shuulain...

13:17.650 --> 13:21.800
She may be over 150 years old, but she's 
always talking down to me and lecturing me.

13:22.460 --> 13:25.200
Gordon's too shy to even hold
a conversation!

13:25.200 --> 13:27.610
Come to think of it, 
I've never even seen his face.

13:29.220 --> 13:30.580
What I'm saying here is...

13:32.100 --> 13:34.080
Don't idealize being in a party.

13:37.590 --> 13:41.560
As for Balmung... Well, since we failed 
to defeat the Demon King, we disbanded.

13:41.560 --> 13:45.970
It's such a relief! Being on my own 
really is the best. Soloing rules!

13:47.050 --> 13:52.010
But, um, you did rely on each other 
while on your adventures, didn't you?

13:52.370 --> 13:54.310
Mutual protection and all that.

13:55.920 --> 13:57.270
I suppose so.

13:58.220 --> 13:59.860
That might be true.

14:02.090 --> 14:03.570
Well, I'll be going now.

14:04.920 --> 14:07.740
All right. Thanks for everything.

14:08.760 --> 14:10.990
Asahi-kun, was it?

14:10.990 --> 14:12.960
I was like that once.

14:13.400 --> 14:16.650
When all I wanted to do was 
save the people in front of me.

14:17.090 --> 14:19.670
That time of innocence,
 when I first started out...

14:23.830 --> 14:26.860
Maybe I'll try cutting back 
a little on the alcohol.

14:29.770 --> 14:33.180
Guess I will apply to one of 
those parties looking for members.

14:34.200 --> 14:36.640
Good timing, Asahi-kun!

14:36.640 --> 14:37.140
Huh?

14:37.140 --> 14:38.710
We just got an urgent quest.

14:38.710 --> 14:42.540
A horde of wyverns are attacking 
a settlement outside of town!

14:42.540 --> 14:43.400
Wyverns?

14:43.400 --> 14:46.600
All the high-ranked 
adventurers are out right now.

14:46.600 --> 14:50.240
Since you already defeated a wyvern, 
I wanted to know if you'd take it on.

14:50.240 --> 14:52.410
<i>It was Maya-nee who killed that one, though.</i>

14:52.650 --> 14:57.620
All right. Then, I'll head back to the inn 
and get Maya-nee... I mean, get ready!

14:57.620 --> 14:59.080
There's no time for that!

14:59.080 --> 15:02.250
There's a wagon waiting to 
take you direct to the location!

15:02.250 --> 15:03.920
What? No, hang on!

15:03.920 --> 15:05.380
Wait!

15:09.170 --> 15:11.680
<i>This is a completely hopeless situation!</i>

15:12.070 --> 15:15.170
<i>And the wagon left right 
after dropping me off!</i>

15:15.170 --> 15:20.250
Um, is there some kind of "Flee" command 
that'll make me faster at running away?

15:28.650 --> 15:30.240
The wyvern is...

15:35.610 --> 15:39.000
I see you are surrounded by 
calamity as usual, young man.

15:39.420 --> 15:40.830
Kilmaria.

15:40.830 --> 15:45.290
That's not very friendly, Asahi. 
You can call me your big sister, you know.

15:46.420 --> 15:49.140
Oh, c'mon. I made a mistake once, that's all.

15:49.550 --> 15:52.340
Hm... Kilmaria-nee? No, too long.

15:52.340 --> 15:54.520
Kil-nee? No, that sounds sort of unsettling.

15:55.240 --> 15:57.140
Are you listening to what I'm saying?

15:57.440 --> 16:00.380
But thanks. You saved me again.

16:01.430 --> 16:04.410
Well, you <i>are</i> weak, Asahi. 
Someone has to save you.

16:04.410 --> 16:09.550
<i>It's not that I'm weak. 
It's that you ladies are way too strong.</i>

16:09.550 --> 16:13.410
But what are you doing here? 
Killing monsters to test your strength again?

16:13.410 --> 16:16.120
I came to return this.

16:18.260 --> 16:19.930
My adventurer badge?

16:20.250 --> 16:23.700
Oh, right. I dropped it
 back then and just left.

16:24.370 --> 16:26.090
Thanks for going to all this trouble.

16:26.090 --> 16:29.830
Well, it was on my way. 
My true objective is...

16:32.010 --> 16:33.650
There were more wyverns?

16:33.650 --> 16:35.800
Fret not, Asahi. I shall defeat them—

16:35.800 --> 16:38.060
Big Sis Thunder!

16:46.550 --> 16:47.610
Maya-nee.

16:47.610 --> 16:48.690
So you've come, Maya.

16:48.690 --> 16:50.650
My true target...

16:50.940 --> 16:52.650
was a rematch with you!

16:53.450 --> 16:55.390
Now, I challenge you...

16:55.390 --> 16:56.970
Are you all right, Asahi?

16:56.970 --> 17:00.170
How could you recklessly leave 
your sister behind to fight wyverns?

17:00.170 --> 17:03.050
Well, events just sort of carried me along.

17:03.050 --> 17:06.690
You're not hurt, are you?
 Here, take a potion. We have lots.

17:06.690 --> 17:09.490
I-I'm fine. Look, not a scratch on me.

17:09.490 --> 17:12.680
Really? Then, let's head home. 
We'll head home right now!

17:10.920 --> 17:13.300
Huh? But, um...

17:13.300 --> 17:14.760
Hold it right there, you!

17:15.140 --> 17:17.390
Oh, you were here, too, 
half-naked horned woman?

17:17.390 --> 17:20.350
Yes, I was! And who are 
you calling "half-naked"?

17:20.350 --> 17:24.800
Your appearance is harmful and tantalizing
 to Asahi. Remove yourself from his sight.

17:24.800 --> 17:28.440
Your outfit isn't any less revealing.
 Look. Your navel's showing.

17:29.290 --> 17:32.480
I told you before. This is the
 kind of outfit Asahi prefers.

17:32.480 --> 17:35.530
My little brother's tastes 
tend toward bikini armor.

17:36.570 --> 17:39.960
Hey! Stop dragging me 
into the middle of this!

17:39.960 --> 17:42.660
He also likes policewomen 
and nurse uniforms,

17:42.660 --> 17:44.730
but unfortunately, in this world...

17:44.730 --> 17:48.330
Yeah, all right! I like them!
But please, just leave it at that!

17:48.330 --> 17:50.370
Asahi... So you really are...

17:50.370 --> 17:52.340
Kilmaria, stop acting so repulsed!

17:52.820 --> 17:55.840
Anyway, our rematch. 
This time, I won't lose, Maya!

17:55.840 --> 17:59.260
Straight
Face

17:56.120 --> 17:58.940
Why must I fight you?

17:59.580 --> 18:01.970
Why? Well, um... What?

18:01.970 --> 18:04.690
N-No one needs a reason to fight, do they?

18:04.690 --> 18:07.340
We're seeing who's better! 
Isn't that enough to fire you up?

18:07.340 --> 18:11.270
Too much trouble. All of my resources go 
toward looking after Asahi, nothing else.

18:11.270 --> 18:12.400
In that case...

18:12.400 --> 18:14.840
I will take your little brother hostage!

18:14.840 --> 18:16.690
Kilmaria! What are you doing?

18:17.700 --> 18:19.840
Play along and give us a pretext to fight.

18:19.840 --> 18:23.420
Come on now. Make a sad face and 
cry out for your sister to save you.

18:23.420 --> 18:25.700
I can't do something that pathetic!

18:25.700 --> 18:27.540
Wait. Where's Maya?

18:26.580 --> 18:26.830
<b>Poof</b>

18:27.080 --> 18:27.330
<b>Poof</b>

18:34.560 --> 18:37.460
Honestly. That woman is 
trouble. Let's go, Asahi.

18:37.460 --> 18:38.630
R-Right.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.880
You don't know when to quit!

18:42.620 --> 18:44.470
Use that rage and come at me!

18:44.470 --> 18:46.560
Don't get above yourself, you hussy!

18:46.560 --> 18:47.890
What did you say?

18:47.890 --> 18:50.100
I-It's a cat fight.

18:51.430 --> 18:52.190
Huh?

18:53.150 --> 18:55.820
What?!

18:55.820 --> 18:56.820
Asahi!

19:01.280 --> 19:03.470
You <i>will</i> let go of Asahi right now!

19:03.470 --> 19:04.560
M-Maya-nee?

19:04.560 --> 19:06.950
Wait! If you defeat this guy up here...

19:06.950 --> 19:10.710
Big Sis Thunder Break!

19:16.780 --> 19:18.950
That was a close one, wasn't it, Asahi?

19:18.950 --> 19:20.260
Kilmaria!

19:26.410 --> 19:28.930
You attacked without a moment's hesitation.

19:29.210 --> 19:30.440
How unexpected.

19:30.440 --> 19:36.690
Because you can fly, Kilmaria. I simply
entrusted it to the right person for the job.

19:36.910 --> 19:40.740
Oh? So you trusted me, huh?
One of the Demon King's Six Generals.

19:41.710 --> 19:42.700
You're being silly.

19:43.040 --> 19:46.660
<i>These two... They really do seem a lot alike.</i>

19:48.280 --> 19:50.060
Now, let's go home, Asahi.

19:50.060 --> 19:51.460
Yeah, okay.

19:51.460 --> 19:52.830
I won't let you!

19:54.590 --> 19:58.210
This time, I won't be caught 
off guard! Now, come at me!

19:58.210 --> 19:59.340
Escape.

19:59.720 --> 20:00.810
Wh-What?

20:01.430 --> 20:02.800
A teleportation skill?

20:02.800 --> 20:04.930
When did you learn that?

20:06.850 --> 20:10.090
Does that mean even if 
I hadn't saved you earlier...

20:10.090 --> 20:12.710
Oh, no, I can't do it unless I focus.

20:12.710 --> 20:15.280
You really did save me earlier. Thank you.

20:15.280 --> 20:16.390
Really?

20:16.390 --> 20:21.370
I thought you would've been able to handle it,
 Asahi. Kilmaria was insurance at most.

20:21.370 --> 20:23.850
At least find out the truth
 before you say stuff!

20:26.550 --> 20:29.370
The Ikusaba siblings 
really are fascinating.

20:29.690 --> 20:32.970
And it seems the little brother
 is more than just weak.

20:33.610 --> 20:34.880
Well, of course!

20:34.880 --> 20:38.800
Asahi isn't just adorable. 
He's growing and improving every day!

20:38.800 --> 20:39.880
Maya-nee.

20:41.070 --> 20:43.380
I suppose I'll leave it at that for today.

20:44.100 --> 20:47.600
Farewell, Maya. Asahi. 
You'll see me again.

20:47.600 --> 20:48.810
That isn't funny.

20:48.810 --> 20:50.490
Asahi, get the purifying salt.

20:55.810 --> 20:57.780
<i>Maya-nee really is...</i>

20:58.910 --> 21:01.150
Why are you looking at me so intently?

21:01.150 --> 21:03.680
Do I have something on my face?

21:03.680 --> 21:04.570
No.

21:06.110 --> 21:09.030
I was just thinking that 
you're all I need, Maya-nee.

21:09.030 --> 21:14.540
Was that a passionate proposal from you 
about how you don't need anything but me?!

21:14.620 --> 21:20.800
<b>Glomp</b>

21:14.620 --> 21:20.800
<b>Glomp</b>

21:14.800 --> 21:16.570
You're all I need, too, Asahi!

21:16.570 --> 21:20.250
You're my top idol, Asahi!

21:18.500 --> 21:20.800
Not in that way! I meant in my party!

21:21.970 --> 21:24.210
Yeah! Tonight is party night!

21:24.210 --> 21:25.630
I won't let you get <i>any</i> sleep!

21:25.630 --> 21:28.500
Not that kind of party!

22:58.890 --> 23:00.900
Say, Asahi...

23:00.900 --> 23:04.890
Why did you mistake me for 
your sister back then, anyway?

23:04.890 --> 23:06.650
You know, when we first met.

23:07.440 --> 23:10.910
<i>I can't tell her it was how her chest felt.</i>

23:10.910 --> 23:13.380
Oh, I see. So that was the reason?

23:13.380 --> 23:15.410
I didn't say anything yet!

23:16.450 --> 23:19.790
I'm a demon. I can easily 
read a human's thoughts.

23:19.790 --> 23:21.900
So I can't hide things from her.

23:21.900 --> 23:25.920
Yeah, you're right. I mistook you because of
 the size of the chest my face got buried in.

23:25.920 --> 23:28.510
That was a joke to trick you
 into telling the truth.

23:28.510 --> 23:31.510
I never imagined it was 
because of the size of my chest.

23:31.510 --> 23:33.030
You tricked me!

23:34.800 --> 23:35.560
<b>Requests for Asahi-kun</b>

23:34.800 --> 23:35.560
<b>Regarding the Ghost</b>

23:35.510 --> 23:36.560
<b>Next Time</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:40.020
Next time: "The Big Plan for the Home
 of the Ikusaba Brother and Sister."

23:36.600 --> 23:36.770
<b>Episode 4</b>

23:36.890 --> 23:40.680
<b>Episode 4</b>

23:37.220 --> 23:40.680
<b>The Big Plan for the Home of the Ikusaba Brother and Sister</b>

23:40.020 --> 23:40.940
<b>Ruuumble</b>
